  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "前排拦不住，后面还有三条更重的路。",
   "spoken": "前排拦不住，后面还有三条更重的路。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 1.695,
   "speechEnd": 5.198
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "一条是链级冻结。",
   "spoken": "一条是链级冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 5.66,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 5.751,
   "speechEnd": 7.444
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "2025 年 5 月，Sui 上的 Cetus 被盗约 2.23 亿美元，根因是集中流动性合约的算术溢出。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 5 月，Sui 上的 Cetus 被盗约 2.23 亿美元，根因是集中流动性合约的算术溢出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 7.88,
   "dur": 9.12,
   "speechStart": 7.986,
   "speechEnd": 16.817
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "约 6300 万美元，在冻结前跨链到了以太坊。",
   "spoken": "约 6300 万美元，在冻结前跨链到了以太坊。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 17.22,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 17.22,
   "speechEnd": 21.816
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "Sui 验证者在链上冻结了约 1.62 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "Sui 验证者在链上冻结了约 1.62 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 22.24,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 22.334,
   "speechEnd": 26.227
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "治理投票以约 90.9% 的质押权通过，用协议升级，把冻结的钱转进三方共管的多签，用于赔付。",
   "spoken": "治理投票以约 90.9% 的质押权通过，用协议升级，把冻结的钱转进三方共管的多签，用于赔付。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 26.7,
   "dur": 9.76,
   "speechStart": 26.798,
   "speechEnd": 36.209
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "钱保住了，争议也来了。",
   "spoken": "钱保住了，争议也来了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 36.68,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 36.771,
   "speechEnd": 39.133
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "部分验证者公开表达了保留意见。",
   "spoken": "部分验证者公开表达了保留意见。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 39.54,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 39.638,
   "speechEnd": 42.097
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "能冻结并改写特定地址，也就说明，这条链的验证者可以干预任意地址。",
   "spoken": "能冻结并改写特定地址，也就说明，这条链的验证者可以干预任意地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 42.48,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 42.579,
   "speechEnd": 48.789
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "Binance 事件里，Arbitrum 安全委员会也强制转走了，攻击者钱包里的 8426 ETH 和 7460 万 ARB。",
   "spoken": "Binance 事件里，Arbitrum 安全委员会也强制转走了，攻击者钱包里的 8426 ETH 和 7460 万 ARB。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 49.18,
   "dur": 10.16,
   "speechStart": 49.278,
   "speechEnd": 59.162
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "一条是谈判与白帽赎回。",
   "spoken": "一条是谈判与白帽赎回。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 59.56,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 59.658,
   "speechEnd": 61.902
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "2021 年 8 月，Poly Network 被盗约 6.1 亿美元，攻击者自称白帽，约 15 天内归还。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 8 月，Poly Network 被盗约 6.1 亿美元，攻击者自称白帽，约 15 天内归环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 62.34,
   "dur": 8.24,
   "speechStart": 62.448,
   "speechEnd": 70.404
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "2023 年 3 月，Euler Finance 被闪电贷攻击，损失约 1.97 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 3 月，Euler Finance 被闪电贷攻击，损失约 1.97 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 70.8,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 70.8,
   "speechEnd": 76.508
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "Euler 提出 10% 的赏金，同时另设 100 万美元悬赏，征集攻击者的线索。",
   "spoken": "Euler 提出 10% 的赏金，同时另设 100 万美元悬赏，征集攻击者的线索。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 76.94,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 77.034,
   "speechEnd": 83.945
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "4 月初，Euler 宣布，全部可追回的资金已经归还。",
   "spoken": "4 月初，Euler 宣布，全部可追回的资金已经归环。",
